                                "sense_id": "94bc590b-b833-39c2-8dd2-a0471795b9e1",
                                "text": "I commend the modern Unitarians for their candour in giving up the possible worshipability of Christ, if not very God."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2932cad9-dd7d-421a-afc1-ca63e2df6d64",
                                "sense_id": "94bc590b-b833-39c2-8dd2-a0471795b9e1",
                                "text": "A God who is totally and completely Other lacks relatability and no doubt, at least to many, he will lack worshipability."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfd5a7b4-ac9b-477d-a814-626866d3f0c4",
                                "sense_id": "94bc590b-b833-39c2-8dd2-a0471795b9e1",
                                "text": "Critics of the openness model are quick to contend that any qualification of the notion of God's complete knowledge of the future diminishes his power and worshipability."
                            }
                        ]
